+/* Finance sets up credit control here: the standard review period, interest rate, late fee, when a balance is overdue enough to be charged, the write-off approval limit, the GL accounts for interest, late fees and bad debts, and the reminder letters. Also loads the current credit status, limits and review dates of customers from a CSV file (go-live) */
